 "remarks": "An inviting 3-bedroom home with an open floor plan, wood floors and a fireplace. The living room flows into the kitchen and dining area, while a separate family room features a cathedral ceiling and doors leading to the deck. Outside, the backyard offers space to relax or entertain, with mature landscaping, established hedges providing privacy along portions of the property, and a storage shed.  The partially finished lower level offers additional space, along with unfinished storage and a workbench area. The home also features a Navien heating system. Just a short walk to Kendall Elementary School and a short drive to Oak Hills Park, offering golf, tennis, walking trails and a restaurant.",
